WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:14.306
Henny Penny was a chicken.

2
00:00:15.406 --> 00:00:17.227
She was a hungry chicken.

3
00:00:18.408 --> 00:00:21.629
One day, she was looking for food on the ground.

4
00:00:22.729 --> 00:00:25.510
Suddenly, a nut fell off of a tree.

5
00:00:26.491 --> 00:00:28.992
The nut hit Henny Penny on the head.

6
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:31.540
"Oh my!

7
00:00:32.061 --> 00:00:33.682
The sky is falling!

8
00:00:34.702 --> 00:00:36.183
I must tell the king!"

9
00:00:36.684 --> 00:00:37.725
Henny Penny said.

10
00:00:38.665 --> 00:00:40.166
She ran by the barn.

11
00:00:41.127 --> 00:00:44.289
Cocky Locky said, "Cock-a-doodle-doo!

12
00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.912
Henny Penny, where are you going?"

13
00:00:49.253 --> 00:00:52.875
Henny Penny replied, "The sky is falling!

14
00:00:53.215 --> 00:00:54.776
I must tell the king!

15
